{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defy gravity and test your reflexes in this fast-paced platformer challenge! Scale treacherous heights, dodge deadly obstacles, and master precise jumps to survive. Use wall jumps and unique power-ups like time freeze, slow motion, and teleportation to push your limits. Choose between two intense modes: climb through the skies in Classic Mode or escape the rising flames in the relentless Inferno Mode. With tight controls, retro aesthetics, and pulse-pounding chiptune music, every moment is a test of skill. How high can you go?</p><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fast-paced arcade gameplay \u2013 Ultra-responsive controls for pure precision.<br></li><li>Retro vibes \u2013 Stylish pixel art with nostalgic visual effects.<br></li><li>Precision platforming \u2013 Wall jumps, tricky landings, and no room for error.<br></li><li>Unique power-ups \u2013 Slow time, freeze hazards, or teleport to escape danger.<br></li><li>Two intense modes \u2013 Reach the skies in Classic Mode or outrun fire in Inferno Mode.<br></li><li>Epic chiptune soundtrack \u2013 Two dynamic tracks fueling the action.</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3527780/47f902fa876acc66f6807708b89ba07728cecdab.jpg"},{"name":"Oops","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3527780/c18ece771274c8df34b52404692e41e7baf20aef.jpg"},{"name":"Professional Climber","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3527780/2399811edbaff5f45f59fea3b6be0ca2f031999c.jpg"},{"name":"Spicy Bath","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3527780/4cc11c85d52433b28dea2c03ef3cd36f9bfdf59c.jpg"},{"name":"Rookie Climber","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3527780/0bcdc9fbcba1bfa42b012a8109ebdcbdc13280c7.jpg"},{"name":"Skywalker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.s